<font color="#FFFFFF">What happened to the gym?</font>

402
00:17:45,376 --> 00:17:47,375
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Chinese restaurant
much more profitable.</font>

403
00:17:47,376 --> 00:17:49,126
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I paid
for a month membership.</font>

404
00:17:49,127 --> 00:17:50,792
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want my money back.</font>

405
00:17:50,793 --> 00:17:52,168
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, so sorry.</font>

406
00:17:52,169 --> 00:17:54,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't read fine print
on contract.</font>

407
00:17:54,044 --> 00:17:56,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">"In event gym turn
to Chinese restaurant,</font>

408
00:17:56,668 --> 00:17:59,084
<font color="#FFFFFF">you bicyc-quow delivery boy."</font>

409
00:17:59,085 --> 00:18:01,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not delivering
your Chinese food on a bicycle.</font>

410
00:18:01,543 --> 00:18:02,835
<font color="#FFFFFF">A what?
A bicycle.</font>

411
00:18:04,044 --> 00:18:06,375
<font color="#FFFFFF">A bicyc-quow.</font>

412
00:18:06,376 --> 00:18:08,169
<font color="#FFFFFF">You ride bicyc-quow!</font>

413
00:18:19,668 --> 00:18:20,792
<font color="#FFFFFF">Klaus, stop!</font>

414
00:18:20,793 --> 00:18:22,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way, Stan.</font>

415
00:18:22,251 --> 00:18:24,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm never going back
in that bowl.</font>

416
00:18:24,044 --> 00:18:25,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">But you could kill yourself.</font>

417
00:18:25,543 --> 00:18:26,626
<font color="#FFFFFF">In my body.</font>

418
00:18:26,627 --> 00:18:28,292
<font color="#FFFFFF">And what a way to go!</font>

419
00:18:28,293 --> 00:18:31,417
<font color="#FFFFFF">The speed,
the wind in your face,</font>

420
00:18:31,418 --> 00:18:32,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the flying.</font>

421
00:18:32,668 --> 00:18:34,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, the flying.</font>

422
00:18:34,543 --> 00:18:36,919
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's nothing else like it
in the world.</font>

423
00:18:44,919 --> 00:18:46,877
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't even try it, Klaus.</font>

424
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:51,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">Enough!</font>

425
00:18:54,210 --> 00:18:56,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">My leg is broken!</font>

426
00:18:56,044 --> 00:18:58,251
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoo-hoo!
Yeah! Whoo!</font>

427
00:19:09,127 --> 00:19:10,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, you can make it!</font>

428
00:19:10,668 --> 00:19:12,209
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen to my body.</font>

429
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:14,543
<font color="#FFFFFF">It knows what to do.</font>

430
00:19:19,376 --> 00:19:21,834
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm… doing it.</font>

431
00:19:21,835 --> 00:19:23,543
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa, whoa, what's going on?</font>

432
00:19:25,418 --> 00:19:26,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">Da Flippity Flop.</font>

433
00:19:26,877 --> 00:19:30,418
<font color="#FFFFFF">Da Flippity Flop, it works!</font>

434
00:19:31,919 --> 00:19:33,417
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my God,</font>

435
00:19:33,418 --> 00:19:35,668
<font color="#FFFFFF">it <i>is</i> like flying.</font>

436
00:19:38,835 --> 00:19:42,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jump City.</font>

437
00:19:44,877 --> 00:19:47,418
<font color="#FFFFFF">This must be
what angels feel li…</font>

438
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:52,084
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, hey, congrats, man.</font>

439
00:19:52,085 --> 00:19:54,085
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's got to be a world record.</font>

440
00:20:05,585 --> 00:20:07,417
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not going anywhere.</font>

441
00:20:07,418 --> 00:20:08,710
<font color="#FFFFFF">Punch in the face.</font>

442
00:20:12,335 --> 00:20:14,959
<font color="#FFFFFF">You think we should've gone
with them to the CIA</font>

443
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:16,709
<font color="#FFFFFF">to make sure there wasn't
another mix-up?</font>

444
00:20:16,710 --> 00:20:18,792
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why don't <i>you</i> go to the CIA.</font>

445
00:20:18,793 --> 00:20:20,126
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're the one with no job.</font>

446
00:20:20,127 --> 00:20:22,417
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, we're home.</font>

447
00:20:22,418 --> 00:20:23,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, thank God.</font>

448
00:20:23,668 --> 00:20:25,126
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold it, honey,
no hugging yet.</font>

449
00:20:25,127 --> 00:20:26,292
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm still pretty sensitive</font>

450
00:20:26,293 --> 00:20:27,709
<font color="#FFFFFF">after having all
those tattoos removed.</font>

451
00:20:27,710 --> 00:20:28,918
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I'm not mad.</font>

452
00:20:28,919 --> 00:20:31,126
<font color="#FFFFFF">These last few days
of living like a fish</font>

453
00:20:31,127 --> 00:20:32,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">have given me a new appreciation
for you, Klaus.</font>

454
00:20:32,877 --> 00:20:34,626
<font color="#FFFFFF">You used to fly,</font>

455
00:20:34,627 --> 00:20:36,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">and now you're trapped
in a bowl.</font>

456
00:20:36,543 --> 00:20:38,751
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your life is harder
than I ever imagined.</font>

457
00:20:38,752 --> 00:20:41,001
<font color="#FFFFFF">I am truly sorry I didn't give
you more respect</font>

458
00:20:41,002 --> 00:20:42,209
<font color="#FFFFFF">through the years,</font>

459
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:44,375
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I vow to find you a new body</font>

460
00:20:44,376 --> 00:20:46,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">so you can be human again.</font>

461
00:20:46,044 --> 00:20:47,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you, Stan.</font>

462
00:20:47,877 --> 00:20:50,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's all I ever wanted.</font>

463
00:20:50,668 --> 00:20:54,251
<font color="#FFFFFF">When do you think
it will happen?
Probably never, buddy.</font>

464
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,877
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

465
00:21:31,002 --> 00:21:33,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioned by Point.360</font>

